%% Contract Review Harness — happy-path run sequence
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Reviewing lawyer
    participant SK as skill://contract-triage
    participant H as contract-review harness
    participant PP as document-parser
    participant RD as pii-redactor
    participant IX as legal-playbook-search
    participant M as Model gateway
    participant AU as Audit store

    U->>SK: Upload MSA, select uk-standard
    SK->>H: run(contract_file, playbook_id, counterparty_tier)
    H->>PP: parse(file, emit_anchors)
    PP-->>H: text + page/paragraph anchors
    H->>RD: redact(text)
    RD-->>H: redacted text (12 placeholders)
    Note over H: Guardrail: no inference before redaction returns

    H->>H: segment into 63 clauses
    loop per clause (concurrency 8)
        H->>M: classify(clause)
        M-->>H: {type, confidence}
    end
    H->>H: route — 58 assessable, 5 low-confidence to human queue

    loop per assessable clause
        H->>IX: hybrid search(clause, playbook filter)
        IX-->>H: top-8 positions + precedents
        H->>M: assess(clause, positions)
        M-->>H: finding JSON
        H->>H: grounding check (exact quote + citation ids)
        alt ungrounded
            H->>M: re-assess (max 2)
            M-->>H: finding JSON
        end
    end

    H->>M: executive summary(findings)
    M-->>H: summary markdown
    H->>H: no-advice output filter
    H->>AU: write audit record (prompts, model build, retrieved ids, guardrails)
    H-->>SK: findings + summary + coverage_report
    SK-->>U: Review queue item (24h SLA)
    U->>H: sign-off: accept / reject per finding
    H->>AU: record sign-off decision
